Materialize the exact sparse AOSP source boundary for Droidloom

Usage: droidloom-source <COMMAND>

Commands:
  verify-lock          Validate the bounded sparse lock without touching the network
  plan                 Print the exact immutable project plan without fetching it
  materialize          Fetch exact commits into a new atomically published source directory
  reconcile            Add newly locked projects to an existing verified materialization
  verify-materialized  Verify an existing materialization without fetching or modifying it
  help                 Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
